              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate one valid oraInfoDisplay response using messageListWidget. Explain in one concise professional sentence that compliance checklist information cannot be displayed right now and suggest trying again later. Use no title, items, actions, links, technical details, or content outside the oraInfoDisplay output."
            }
          ],
          "diagram": {
